tool.command:
#if str($connection.transport) == "api"
    beacon2-query gene
        @PROVIDER_ARGS@
        @VARIANT_CLASS_ARGS@
        --gene-id '$gene_id'
        --granularity '$granularity'
        --limit $pagination.limit
        --skip $pagination.skip
        @SAMPLE_ARGS@
        @CNV_TERM_ARGS@
        @SMALL_VARIANT_TERM_ARGS@
        @SV_TERM_ARGS@
        #if str($advanced.variant_min_length)
            --variant-min-length $advanced.variant_min_length
        #end if
        #if str($advanced.variant_max_length)
            --variant-max-length $advanced.variant_max_length
        #end if
        @FILTER_ARGS@
        @OUTPUT_ARGS@
#else
    beacon2-query gene
        --transport mongodb
        --db-host '$connection.db_host'
        --db-port $connection.db_port
        --database '$connection.database'
        --collection '$connection.collection'
        --credentials-file '$credentials'
        @VARIANT_CLASS_ARGS@
        --gene-id '$gene_id'
        @CNV_TERM_ARGS@
        @OUTPUT_ARGS@
#end if

tool.help:
**What it does**

@HELP_READS@

Finds variants in a gene, given its HGNC symbol, across every beacon you select.
Combine it with a variant class and a term to ask, for example, for deletions in
TP53. Whether each beacon matches by gene annotation or by the gene's position
is that beacon's choice.

@HELP_VARIANT_CLASS@

@HELP_OUTPUTS@
